<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  Landing page for the PokerTH F-Droid repository. The publish workflow
  substitutes %%REPO_URL%%, %%ADD_URL%%, %%FINGERPRINT%% and %%VERSION%% and
  uploads the result next to repo/ and archive/.
-->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>PokerTH for Android — F-Droid repository</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; --bg: #f6f6f4; --fg: #1c1c1a; --muted: #5c5c56;
          --card: #ffffff; --border: #dcdcd6; --accent: #1d6b3a; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #16171a; --fg: #ececee; --muted: #a0a0a8; --card: #1f2126;
            --border: #32343a; --accent: #4cbd77; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
         font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  header img { width: 64px; height: 64px; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .75rem; }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); margin: .25rem 0 0; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px;
          padding: 1.25rem; }
  .add { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .add img { width: 168px; height: 168px; background: #fff; padding: 8px; border-radius: 8px; }
  a.button { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; text-decoration: none;
             padding: .6rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
  code, .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .85rem; }
  .fp { word-break: break-all; display: block; margin-top: .35rem; color: var(--muted); }
  ol { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  footer { margin-top: 3rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem; }
  footer a, main p a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header>
    <img src="icon.png" alt="">
    <div>
      <h1>PokerTH for Android</h1>
      <p class="sub">F-Droid repository · current version %%VERSION%%</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="card add">
    <img src="qr.png" alt="QR code for the repository address">
    <div>
      <p><a class="button" href="%%ADD_URL%%">Add repository to F-Droid</a></p>
      <p class="sub">Scan the QR code in F-Droid, tap the button on your phone, or
      add the address by hand:</p>
      <code>%%REPO_URL%%</code>
      <span class="fp mono">Fingerprint: %%FINGERPRINT%%</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Manually</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Install the <a href="https://f-droid.org/">F-Droid</a> app.</li>
    <li>Open <em>Settings → Repositories</em> and tap <em>+</em>.</li>
    <li>Enter the address above and confirm — check that the fingerprint shown
        matches the one on this page.</li>
    <li>Update the app list; PokerTH now appears and updates like any other app.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Why a separate repository?</h2>
  <p>f-droid.org compiles every app from source on its own build servers and does
  not accept the prebuilt Qt libraries this client is built with. Rather than
  leave Android users without an F-Droid path, we sign and host our own
  repository — the same approach KDE and other Qt projects take.</p>

  <h2>Which file does my phone get?</h2>
  <p>Each release ships as separate APKs for 64-bit ARM, 32-bit ARM and x86_64,
  plus a build for Android 8 devices. F-Droid picks the right one automatically.</p>

  <footer>
    PokerTH is free software under the AGPLv3 —
    <a href="https://github.com/pokerth/pokerth">source code</a> ·
    <a href="https://www.pokerth.net">pokerth.net</a>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
